w-2935443049","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"MEMBER","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2935443049"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587"}},"submitted_at":"2025-06-17T12:24:28Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2939946543,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vPAYv","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?u=34072b401722100a7c0c0d61e37b376cf22b4545&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"When suggesting `__COUNTER__` for assertion reuse, this is what I was referring to:\r\n```cpp\r\n// typedefs.h\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter, typename = void>\r\nstruct is_fully_defined : std::false_type {};\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter>\r\nstruct is_fully_defined<T, Counter, std::void_t<decltype(sizeof(T))>> : std::true_type {};\r\n\r\ntemplate <typename T, int Counter>\r\nconstexpr bool is_fully_defined_v = is_fully_defined<T, Counter>::value;\r\n\r\n#if !defined(SCU_BUILD_ENABLED) && !defined(DEV_ENABLED) && !defined(DEBUG_ENABLED)\r\n/// Enforces the requirement that a class is not fully defined.\r\n/// This can be used to reduce include coupling and keep compile times low.\r\n/// The check must be made at the top of the corresponding .cpp file of a header.\r\n#define STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(m_type) \\\r\n\tclass m_type;                              \\\r\n\tstatic_assert(!is_fully_defined_v<m_type, __COUNTER__>, #m_type \" was unexpectedly fully defined. Please check the include hierarchy of '\" __FILE__ \"' and remove includes that resolve the class.\");\r\n#else\r\n#define STATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(m_type)\r\n#endif\r\n\r\n...\r\n// ustring.cpp\r\n\r\n#include \"ustring.h\"\r\n\r\nSTATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(Dictionary); // Expectation: pass.\r\n// Old: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary>. Passes.\r\n// New: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary, 0>. Passes.\r\n\r\n#include \"core/variant/dictionary.h\"\r\n\r\nSTATIC_ASSERT_INCOMPLETE_CLASS(Dictionary); // Expectation: fail.\r\n// Old: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary>. Reuses previous template. Passes.\r\n// New: !is_fully_defined_v<Dictionary, 1>. Distinct template. Fails.\r\n```","state":"COMMENTED","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2939946543","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","_links":{"html":{"href":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/107587#pullrequestreview-2939946543"},"pull_request":{"href":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/107587"}},"submitted_at":"2025-06-18T16:53:23Z","commit_id":null},{"id":2945143994,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc6vi1S6","user":{"login":"Ivorforce","id":2308167,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIzMDgxNjc=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2308167?u=f7f8e0273f784f5ec6f6b7fe4a88d449896eb48a&v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce","html_url":"https://github.com/Ivorforce","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Ivorforce/followers","following_url":"http